# Files in this PWA are byte-pinned by Subresource Integrity and the
# offline/service-worker integrity manifest. Git for Windows must check
# text assets out as LF even when core.autocrlf is globally enabled.
# Apply only to text formats; images, videos, fonts and archives remain binary.
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.webmanifest text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.frag text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
NOTICE text eol=lf
COPYING text eol=lf
AUTHORS text eol=lf
